#. そうだ…！　<CLT 3>チェスの駒<CLT>だよ…！
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That's it! The <CLT 3>chess pieces<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. ボトルの中のモノクマフィギュアが持ってるのは、
#. 全部、チェスの駒なんだ。
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Inside each bottle there was a Monokuma figure holding\n"
"a different chess piece."
msgstr ""

#. キング、ルーク、ビショップ、ポーン…
#. 確かに、すべてチェスの駒だな…
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"King, rook, bishop, pawn... I definitely remember\n"
"seeing each of those."
msgstr ""

#. それと、割れたモノクマボトルの中に入ってた
#. モノクマフィギュアは…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And the piece that was inside the broken bottle we\n"
"found was..."
msgstr ""

#. ナイトの駒…だったよね？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...the knight, if I remember."
msgstr ""

#. そ、それが…どうしたのよ…？
msgctxt "0006 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "So? What's that m-matter?"
msgstr ""

#. あなたは、チェスにはあまり詳しくないのね。
#. だったら教えてあげるわ…
msgctxt "0007 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I guess you don't know too much about chess, do you?\n"
"Then let me explain..."
msgstr ""

#. チェスの駒の種類は、キング、クイーン、ルーク、
#. ナイト、ビショップ、ポーン、全部で<CLT 3>６種類<CLT>なのよ。
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"In chess, there are <CLT 3>six different pieces<CLT>—the king,\n"
"the queen, the rook, knight, bishop, and pawn."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、あの現場に残されていたのは、
#. キング、ルーク、ビショップ、ポーンの４体と…
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What was left intact at the crime scene were the king,\n"
"rook, bishop, and pawn...just those four."
msgstr ""

#. 床に落ちていたナイトだけ…
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "And on the ground was the knight."
msgstr ""

#. あ！　<CLT 3>クイーンのフィギュア<CLT>が足りないんだ！
msgctxt "0011 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "...Oh! So the <CLT 3>queen<CLT> is missing!"
msgstr ""

#. そうなんだ。現場にあったモノクマボトルは５本…
#. つまり、１本足りないんだよ。
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So we only have evidence for five bottles at the\n"
"scene, while one apparently went missing."
msgstr ""

#. な、何よ…チェスがなんだって言うのよ…！
msgctxt "0013 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "What does ch-chess have to do with anything!?"
msgstr ""

#. 日本人なら将棋だべ！
msgctxt "0014 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Yeah! Shogi is way better!"
msgstr ""

#. …そうよ！
#. じゃなくて、あたしが言いたいのは…ッ！
msgctxt "0015 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Yeah!\n"
"...Wait, n-no! That's not what I mean!"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに…ボトルは足りなくなってるかもしれないけど…
msgctxt "0016 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "So, let's say a b-bottle did go missing..."
msgstr ""

#. それが事件と関係している根拠なんて…
#. ど、どこにもないじゃない…
msgctxt "0017 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Th-There's still no evidence that h-has anything to do\n"
"w-with this case!"
msgstr ""

#. 事件前から…すでに１本欠けてたのかも…
#. し、しれないじゃない…ッ！
msgctxt "0018 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"That bottle c-could have disappeared anytime b-before\n"
"the murder!"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ、なくなったモノクマボトルが
#. 事件に関係しているのは明白よ。
msgctxt "0019 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"No, it's clear that the missing bottle *is* connected\n"
"to this case."
msgstr ""

#. な、なんで明白なのよッ！！
msgctxt "0020 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "H-How is it clear!?"
msgstr ""

#. なくなったモノクマボトルはどういう状態だったか…
#. それを考えてみれば、わかるはずよ。
msgctxt "0021 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Think about what state the missing bottle must have\n"
"been in. Maybe then you'll understand..."
msgstr ""

#. 割れた状態
msgctxt "0022 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "It was broken"
msgstr ""

#. 興奮状態
msgctxt "0023 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "It was excited"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマボトルは興奮状態だったんだ…！！
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The Monokuma Bottle must have been really excited...!"
msgstr ""

#. …………………
msgctxt "0025 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 知らなかったよ…
#. 苗木も…残念な人だったんだね…！
msgctxt "0026 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Makoto... I had no idea *you'd* turn out to be just as\n"
"big of a disappointment..."
msgstr ""

#. 俺の方を見ながら、
#. 言わないで欲しいべ！
msgctxt "0027 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"H-Hey! I'd appreciate it if you didn't look right at\n"
"me when you say that!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 傷１つない状態
msgctxt "0029 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "It was completely intact"
msgstr ""

#. そうじゃないわ…
msgctxt "0030 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "No, that can't be right."
msgstr ""

#. あの実験の事を思い出して…
msgctxt "0031 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Recall the experiment we did..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>あの実験って言うと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You mentioned an experiment...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あなたに手伝ってもらった実験の事を
#. 思い出して。
msgctxt "0034 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's right. The one you helped me perform."
msgstr ""

#. そうすればわかるはずよ。
msgctxt "0035 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Think back to that, and it should become clear."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>あの実験って言うと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You mentioned an experiment...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>現場に残されてたモノクマボトルの
#. 破片のことだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You're talking about when we weighed those broken\n"
"pieces of the Monokuma Bottle, right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なくなったモノクマボトルの状態…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Wait...then the bottle that was missing...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なくなったモノクマボトルは、
#. おそらく、<CLT 3>割れた状態<CLT>だったはずだよ…
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The bottle must have been <CLT 3>broken<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. ど、どうして…そんな事がわかるのよ…ッ！
msgctxt "0041 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "What m-makes you so sure!?"
msgstr ""

#. だって…<CLT 3>証拠<CLT>も残ってるから…
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Because there was <CLT 3>evidence<CLT> at the scene that\n"
"supports it."
msgstr ""

#. 証拠…？
msgctxt "0043 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Hả?"

#. 現場で割られたボトルが、
#. １本だけじゃないって事を示す証拠だよ。
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"That's right. We found evidence that shows there was\n"
"more than just one broken bottle at the scene."
msgstr ""

#. な、なんなのよ…その証拠って…！
msgctxt "0045 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "And what is this e-evidence!?"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ…
#. それ単体では証拠にならないわ。
msgctxt "0046 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "No. That by itself isn't ample evidence."
msgstr ""

#. それらを使って行った事…
#. 証拠になるのはそっちよ。
msgctxt "0047 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What you need to show them is what we used to figure\n"
"it out ourselves."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. いいえ…
#. それ単体では証拠にならないわ。
msgctxt "0049 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "No. That by itself isn't ample evidence."
msgstr ""

#. それらを使って行った事…
#. 証拠になるのはそっちよ。
msgctxt "0050 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What you need to show them is what we used to figure\n"
"it out ourselves."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. はぁ…？　そんなのが証拠だっていうの…？
msgctxt "0052 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Huh? Is that really supposed to c-convince us?"
msgstr ""

#. や、やっぱり、証拠なんてないんでしょ！？
#. 適当な事を…言ってるんだわ！
msgctxt "0053 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"It's not e-evidence at all! Don't do th-things\n"
"half-assed...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 苗木っち、時間かけ過ぎだべ！
#. 将棋だったら、とっくに持ち時間切れになってるぞ！
msgctxt "0055 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Stop taking so long, Makoto! If this was chess, you'd\n"
"have heard the buzzer by now for sure!"
msgstr ""

#. こ、このまま本当に時間切れになったらどうすんだ？
#. まとめて処刑されちまうかも…！
msgctxt "0056 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"H-Hey, what are we gonna do if we really DO run out of\n"
"time! We're all gonna die!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>割られたモノクマボトルは１本じゃなかった…
#. それを示す証拠は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It wasn't just a single broken bottle. And the\n"
"evidence that proves that is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>割られたモノクマボトルは１本じゃなかった…
#. それを示す証拠…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It wasn't just a single broken bottle. And the\n"
"evidence that proves that is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>さっき…ボクと霧切さんとで試してみたよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko and I figured it out before...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. さっき、ボクと霧切さんは、
#. ちょっとした<CLT 3>実験<CLT>をしてみたんだよ。
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Earlier, Kyoko and I did a little <CLT 3>experiment<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 現場に散乱してたボトルの破片と、
#. 割れてないモノクマボトルの重さを比べてみたんだ。
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"We compared the weight of the broken bottle pieces at\n"
"the scene to one of the unbroken bottles."
msgstr ""

#. そうしたら、<CLT 3>集めた破片の方が重く<CLT>なったんだ。
#. そんな結果になった理由は…
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And what we found was that the <CLT 3>collection of pieces\n"
"was heavier<CLT>. And the reason for that is..."
msgstr ""

#. 現場に散乱してた破片が、
#. ボトル１本分より多かったからなんだよ。
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...there was actually more than one bottle's worth of\n"
"shattered glass."
msgstr ""

#. …あッ！
msgctxt "0065 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Wh—!?"
msgstr "Cái—!?"

#. つまり、あの現場では、
#. <CLT 3>２本<CLT>のモノクマボトルが割られていたのよ…
msgctxt "0066 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So from this, we can surmise that <CLT 3>two bottles<CLT> were\n"
"actually broken at the scene of the crime."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、その内１本分の破片とモノクマフィギュアは
#. 何者かに処分された…
msgctxt "0067 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But someone did their best to clean up the pieces of\n"
"one of the bottles, along with the figure inside."
msgstr ""

#. その際、その人物は、
#. 破片を多めに残してしまったんでしょうね…
msgctxt "0068 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But when they did, they must have left behind a few\n"
"too many pieces."
msgstr ""

#. まぁ、きっちり量れというのも難しい話でしょうけど…
msgctxt "0069 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Which is only natural. They certainly had no way to\n"
"measure the exact right number of pieces to remove."
msgstr ""

#. でも、破片を処分って…
#. どうして、そんな事をする必要があったの？
msgctxt "0070 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"But...why would they have to try and get rid of it\n"
"like that, anyway?"
msgstr ""

#. それが、事件に関係する物だったからだよ。
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Because of what it would reveal about the case..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>処分されたモノクマボトルが、
#. 事件に関係していたのは間違いない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There can be no doubt that the second missing Monokuma\n"
"Bottle is involved in this case.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 大神の２発目の殴打
msgctxt "0073 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Sakura's second attacker"
msgstr ""

#. ボウリング
msgctxt "0074 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Some bowling aficionados"
msgstr ""

#. 腐川っちとオーガは、
#. モノクマボトルでボウリングを楽しんだんだべ…
msgctxt "0075 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Toko and Ogre were having fun bowling, using the\n"
"Monokuma Bottles as pins."
msgstr ""

#. その時に、
#. 腐川っちが投げた球がオーガに…
msgctxt "0076 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "But Toko threw her ball a little too hard, and—!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君、あなたのせいで時間を無駄にしたわ…
msgctxt "0077 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Well, Makoto. Thank you very much for wasting all our\n"
"time."
msgstr ""

#. えーと…ごめん…
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, um...sorry."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 大神の１発目の殴打
msgctxt "0080 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Sakura's first attacker"
msgstr ""

#. それはねーべ！
msgctxt "0081 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "No, you're wrong!"
msgstr "Kh-Không phải, mọi người sai rồi!"

#. あの時、モノクマボトルは間違いなく割れたべ！
#. でも、俺が使ったのは１本だけだべ！
msgctxt "0082 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Yeah, the Monokuma Bottle definitely broke when I hit\n"
"her. But I only used the one bottle!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>１発目の殴打のときじゃないとすると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If it's not related to the first time she was\n"
"attacked...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そうか…わかったぞ！
msgctxt "0085 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Ah! I've figured it out!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0086 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ".."
msgstr ""

#. も、もうちょっと
#. 俺の発言にも興味を持ってほしいべ！！
msgctxt "0087 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I wish you'd at least acknowledge me when I say stuff\n"
"like that!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>…早く答えないと雰囲気が悪くなりそうだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Things are gonna go from bad to worse if I don't hurry\n"
"up and explain this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Mình phải nhanh chóng giải thích thôi, không thì bầu\n"
"không khí sẽ tệ đi mất.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>モノクマボトルが割れるような使い方…
#. そんな使い方って…あの時しかないはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The reason the second Monokuma Bottle was broken...\n"
"There's only one explanation for it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だとすると、あれが使われたのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It must have been used by...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんの<CLT 3>２発目の殴打<CLT>…
#. 処分されたモノクマボトルはそこで使われたんだよ。
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The bottle that was removed from the scene was used\n"
"the <CLT 3>second time<CLT> Sakura was attacked."
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんの頭部にあった２つの傷…
#. 割られた２本のボトル…
msgctxt "0093 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The second wound on Sakura's head came from that\n"
"second bottle."
msgstr ""

#. それらを踏まえて考えてみれば、
#. 導き出される結論は、それしかないわ…
msgctxt "0094 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Given all the evidence, this is the only possible\n"
"conclusion."
msgstr ""

#. そして、犯人は１本分の破片だけを処分する事で、
#. 殴打は１回だったと見せかけようとしたんだ。
msgctxt "0095 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The killer wanted to make it look like there was only\n"
"one attack, so they had to get rid of their evidence."
msgstr ""

#. だとすると、２発目の殴打を行った人物は、
#. 葉隠君以外の誰かという事になるはずよ。
msgctxt "0096 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"From there, we can conclude that it wasn't Hiro who\n"
"delivered that second blow."
msgstr ""

#. そうよね、腐川さん？
msgctxt "0097 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Wouldn't you agree, Toko?"
msgstr ""

#. ええ…ッ！？
msgctxt "0098 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Wh—!?"
msgstr "Cái—!?"

#. 雑誌を隠した件もあるし…
#. あなたが事件前後に、娯楽室を訪れた可能性は高いわ。
msgctxt "0099 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And there's the matter of the magazine. You must have\n"
"been in the rec room when the incident took place."
msgstr ""

#. ま、ま、ま、待ってよ…
#. 確かに…２発目の殴打はあったかもしれないけど…
msgctxt "0100 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"W-W-W-Wait! I admit, maybe there was a s-second\n"
"attack, but..."
msgstr ""

#. そ、それをやったのが…あたしって根拠は…
#. どこにも…ないはずよ…！
msgctxt "0101 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"But there's n-no evidence I had anything t-to do with\n"
"it!"
msgstr ""

#. いや、間違いない！　オメーが犯人だべ！
msgctxt "0102 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "No way! You killed her, I'm sure of it!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あんた…！　さっきまで自分が犯人だって、
#. 言ってたクセに…ッ！！
msgctxt "0103 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Sh-Shut up! Until two seconds ago, y-you were claiming\n"
"*you* k-killed her!"
msgstr ""

#. 俺は自分の過ちを認める事を恐れないんだ！
#. そういうタイプなんだべ！
msgctxt "0104 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I'm not afraid to admit when I'm wrong! That's just\n"
"the kinda guy I am!"
msgstr ""

#. それに、そう断言出来る根拠も思い出したぞ！
msgctxt "0105 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Plus, I just remembered something that proves it!"
msgstr ""

#. 一応、聞いておこうか…
msgctxt "0106 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Okay, fine, let's hear it..."
msgstr ""

#. あれは、俺がオーガに呼び出された直後の事だべ…
msgctxt "0107 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "It was right after I got Ogre's note..."
msgstr ""

#. いきなり呼び出されて不安だった俺は、
#. 予定時間より早く娯楽室の前で張り込みをしてたんだ。
msgctxt "0108 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I was kinda nervous about it, so I went to the rec\n"
"room early. Y'know, to stake it out or whatever..."
msgstr ""

#. そんで、しばらくしたところで、
#. 俺は見たんだ…
msgctxt "0109 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "So I was waitin' there, and that's when I saw her..."
msgstr ""

#. 腐川っちが、娯楽室に入ってくとこをな！
msgctxt "0110 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I saw Toko go into the rec room!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐川さんが…娯楽室に…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0111 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You did...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr "Cậu tìm thấy gì sao...?"

#. その直後、今度はオーガが娯楽室に入っていった…
msgctxt "0112 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Pretty soon, Ogre showed up and *she* went in the rec\n"
"room!"
msgstr ""

#. だから、部屋の中には腐川っちもいると思って、
#. 俺は安心して娯楽室に入ったのに…
msgctxt "0113 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I assumed Toko was still in there, so I figured\n"
"everything would be okay. That's why I headed in..."
msgstr ""

#. そこにいたのはオーガだけだったんだ！
#. 腐川っちは、消えちまってたんだべ！！
msgctxt "0114 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"But when I got inside, Ogre was all alone! Toko had\n"
"disappeared!"
msgstr ""

#. なぜ…そんな大事な事を今になって言う…
msgctxt "0115 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "And you just now decided to share that with us...?"
msgstr ""

#. 自分が殺人を犯してしまったというショックで、
#. すっかり忘れていたべ！
msgctxt "0116 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"After the shock of thinking I'd killed someone, I\n"
"forgot all about it!"
msgstr ""

#. 誰か、あいつの頭のネジを探してやれ。
msgctxt "0117 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Could someone tighten the screws on his brain?\n"
"I think they've come loose..."
msgstr ""

#. おい、腐川っち！
#. あの時、オメーはどこに消えてたんだ！！
msgctxt "0118 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "So, Toko! Where the heck did you disappear to!?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あんたの見間違いよ…
#. あたしは…娯楽室なんかに行ってないわ…！
msgctxt "0119 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You d-don't know what you're talking about. I never\n"
"went in the r-rec room!"
msgstr ""

#. 消えたんじゃなくて隠れていたのかもね？
#. 娯楽室のどこかに…
msgctxt "0120 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I'm sure she didn't disappear, but maybe she found\n"
"somewhere to hide..."
msgstr ""

#. …なッ！！
msgctxt "0121 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cái gì!?"

#. あ、あたしが娯楽室に隠れてたなんて…
#. そんな訳…な、ないじゃない…ッ！
msgctxt "0122 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Hiding i-in the rec room? \n"
"Don't be r-r-ridiculous!"
msgstr ""

#. なななんなのよ…！　妙な言いがかりばっかり！
#. こここここの害虫…どもももめ…ッ！
msgctxt "0123 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Wh-Wh-Wh-Why are you all ganging up on me! You're all\n"
"nothing but v-v-v-vermin!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、言いがかりなんかじゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0124 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, it's not ridiculous at all.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐川さんが娯楽室に隠れてたと考えられる根拠は、
#. ちゃんとあったはずだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0125 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's definitely proof that shows Toko was hiding in\n"
"the rec room...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、言いがかりなんかじゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0126 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, it's not ridiculous at all.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐川さんが娯楽室に隠れてたと考えられる根拠…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0127 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need proof that shows Toko was hiding in the rec\n"
"room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それは娯楽室の“あの場所”に、
#. ちゃんと残されていたはずだ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0128 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And I have it. She left it there for anyone to\n"
"find...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
